---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="Ryzo Studios was founded by Pixar veterans Erica Milsom and Todd Shaiman, in partnership with researchers at Stanford and UCSF, to reimagine social-emotional learning for the next generation."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="hero-bg"></div>
    <div class="container hero-content">
      <span class="eyebrow">About Ryzo Studios</span>
      <h1 class="display">
        Where play<br />
        <span class="accent-text">meets purpose.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Ryzo Studios makes films, games, and live events for kids 10 and up. We're a small team out of Pixar, Google, and Warner Bros., working alongside clinicians who study how kids actually handle the hard stuff.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Principles -->
  <section class="section how-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="principles-grid">
        <div class="principles-left">
          <span class="eyebrow">Principles</span>
          <h2 class="subheadline">How we work.</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="principles">
          <div class="principle">
            <div class="principle-icon">
              <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M12 2v4M12 18v4M4.93 4.93l2.83 2.83M16.24 16.24l2.83 2.83M2 12h4M18 12h4M4.93 19.07l2.83-2.83M16.24 7.76l2.83-2.83"/>
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="principle-body">
              <h3 class="principle-title">Entertainment comes first.</h3>
              <p>
                We make things kids want to watch and play, using everything
                that makes a story work: character, stakes, emotion, surprise,
                fun. Impact that doesn't entertain first is homework, and kids
                can tell the difference.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="principle">
            <div class="principle-icon">
              <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <circle cx="5" cy="5" r="2"/><circle cx="19" cy="5" r="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="19" r="2"/>
                <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="2"/><circle cx="19" cy="16" r="2"/><circle cx="5" cy="16" r="2"/>
                <line x1="7" y1="5" x2="10" y2="10"/><line x1="17" y1="5" x2="14" y2="10"/>
                <line x1="12" y1="12" x2="12" y2="17"/><line x1="7" y1="16" x2="10" y2="19"/>
                <line x1="17" y1="16" x2="14" y2="19"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="principle-body">
              <h3 class="principle-title">We create franchises.</h3>
              <p>
                We build story worlds, not one-off titles. A film, a game, a
                live event, and eventually books and merch, all sharing one
                world — so a kid can enter anywhere and go deeper in any
                direction. We own the IP outright, which is what makes that
                possible.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="principle">
            <div class="principle-icon">
              <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polygon points="12 2 15 9 22 9 16.5 13.5 18.5 21 12 16.5 5.5 21 7.5 13.5 2 9 9 9"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div class="principle-body">
              <h3 class="principle-title">We build toward action.</h3>
              <p>
                Each franchise starts from a question we can answer plainly:
                after a kid experiences this, what can they do differently?
                That answer shapes everything we make next.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Founders -->
  <section class="section founders-section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Founders</span>
      <h2 class="subheadline">Where it started.</h2>
      <div class="founders-grid">

        <div class="founder-card">
          <div class="founder-photo">
            <img src="/images/team/erica-milsom.png" alt="Erica Milsom" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="photo-fallback" aria-hidden="true">EM</div>
          </div>
          <div class="founder-header">
            <h3 class="founder-name">Erica Milsom</h3>
            <span class="founder-title">Co-Founder & Chief Creative Officer</span>
          </div>
          <div class="founder-bios">
            <p class="founder-bio">
              Writer, director, and creative executive with 20 years at Pixar
              Animation Studios, where she pioneered the studio's unscripted
              programming strategy for Disney+. Director of <em>Loop</em>,
              featuring Pixar's first non-verbal autistic character, and
              Emmy-nominated Co-Showrunner of <em>Inside Pixar</em>.
            </p>
            <p class="founder-bio">
              Selected as a Bellagio Center Resident by The Rockefeller
              Foundation, the sole animation professional among an
              international cohort of world leaders. Leads Ryzo's first franchise.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="founder-card">
          <div class="founder-photo">
            <img src="/images/team/todd-shaiman.jpg" alt="Todd Shaiman" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="photo-fallback" aria-hidden="true">TS</div>
          </div>
          <div class="founder-header">
            <h3 class="founder-name">Todd Shaiman</h3>
            <span class="founder-title">Co-Founder & President</span>
          </div>
          <div class="founder-bios">
            <p class="founder-bio">
              Production strategist and technologist with 10 years at Pixar,
              where he led workflow innovations on <em>Up</em>, <em>Inside Out</em>,
              and <em>Brave</em>. Founded Google's award-winning Immersive Arts
              team and co-invented AI collaboration tools, two patents, now
              shipping across Google Workspace's 3 billion users.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Leadership -->
  <section class="section leadership-section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Leadership</span>
      <div class="leadership-grid">

        <div class="person-card">
          <div class="person-photo">
            <img src="/images/team/suzanne-slatcher.jpg" alt="Suzanne Slatcher" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="photo-fallback" aria-hidden="true">SS</div>
          </div>
          <div class="person-info">
            <h3 class="person-name">Suzanne Slatcher</h3>
            <span class="person-title">Chief Technology Officer</span>
            <p class="person-bio">Animation director and creative technologist, 25+ years across feature film, TV, and web. At Pixar she built sequences and environments for <em>Finding Nemo</em>, <em>WALL-E</em>, <em>Up</em>, <em>Toy Story 3</em>, and <em>The Incredibles</em>. Leads the pipeline that lets a team this size ship at this scale.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="person-card">
          <div class="person-photo">
            <img src="/images/team/tehya-kopp.jpg" alt="Tehya Kopp" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="photo-fallback" aria-hidden="true">TK</div>
          </div>
          <div class="person-info">
            <h3 class="person-name">Tehya Kopp</h3>
            <span class="person-title">Chief Impact Officer</span>
            <p class="person-bio">Marketing, strategy, and operations leadership from 20+ years at Warner Bros., where she ran global operations across 18 countries. Works with changemakers to turn plans into results.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Advisors -->
  <section class="section advisors-section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Advisors</span>
      <h2 class="subheadline">Who we build with.</h2>
      <p class="build-with-intro">We develop our work in partnership with researchers and clinicians. We choose individuals over institutions on purpose: we'd rather have the person who wrote the book in a story meeting than a logo on a slide.</p>
      <div class="advisors-grid">

        <div class="advisor-card">
          <div class="advisor-photo">
            <img src="/images/team/judy-chu.png" alt="Dr. Judy Chu" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="photo-fallback" aria-hidden="true">JC</div>
          </div>
          <div class="advisor-info">
            <h3 class="advisor-name">Dr. Judy Chu</h3>
            <span class="advisor-affil">Stanford University</span>
            <p class="advisor-bio">Studies how boys lose access to their emotional lives in early adolescence. Author of <em>When Boys Become Boys</em>, and chair of the Movember Foundation's global men's health advisory committee.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="advisor-card">
          <div class="advisor-photo">
            <img src="/images/team/jon-brandt.png" alt="Dr. Jon Brandt" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="photo-fallback" aria-hidden="true">JB</div>
          </div>
          <div class="advisor-info">
            <h3 class="advisor-name">Dr. Jon Brandt</h3>
            <span class="advisor-affil">Adobe Research</span>
            <p class="advisor-bio">Founded Adobe's Media Intelligence Lab. Advises on the AI-forward pipeline that lets a small team ship franchise-scale work.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="advisor-card">
          <div class="advisor-photo">
            <img src="/images/team/gowri-aragam.jpg" alt="Dr. Gowri Aragam" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="photo-fallback" aria-hidden="true">GA</div>
          </div>
          <div class="advisor-info">
            <h3 class="advisor-name">Dr. Gowri Aragam</h3>
            <span class="advisor-affil">UCSF</span>
            <p class="advisor-bio">Harvard-trained psychiatrist. Co-founded Stanford's Brainstorm Lab for Mental Health Innovation and built Pinterest's compassionate search features. Keeps our emotional content clinically sound.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="advisor-card">
          <div class="advisor-photo">
            <img src="/images/team/scott-shigeoka.png" alt="Scott Shigeoka" loading="lazy" />
            <div class="photo-fallback" aria-hidden="true">SS</div>
          </div>
          <div class="advisor-info">
            <h3 class="advisor-name">Scott Shigeoka</h3>
            <span class="advisor-affil">UC Berkeley</span>
            <p class="advisor-bio">Author of <em>Seek</em> and a TED speaker on curiosity as a practice, which is exactly what our live events ask of kids.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="advisor-card">
          <div class="advisor-photo">
            <div class="photo-fallback" aria-hidden="true">DW</div>
          </div>
          <div class="advisor-info">
            <h3 class="advisor-name">The Digital Wellness Lab</h3>
            <span class="advisor-affil">Boston Children's Hospital</span>
            <p class="advisor-bio">Advises on measurement and impact methodology. Ryzo Studios is a signatory of their Inspired Internet Pledge.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Team -->
  <section class="section team-section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">The Crew</span>
      <h2 class="subheadline">The crew.</h2>
      <div class="team-list">
        {[
          { name: 'Ty Goodwin',               role: 'Creative Director',                    photo: 'ty-goodwin.jpg' },
          { name: 'Daniel Tong',              role: 'Editorial',                            photo: 'daniel-tong.jpg' },
          { name: 'Robert Beebout',           role: 'Technical Director & Animator',        photo: 'robert-beebout.jpg' },
          { name: 'H.K. Boughazian',          role: 'Unreal Production Supervisor',         photo: 'hk-boughazian.jpg' },
          { name: 'Moses Yashua Hutton Mays', role: 'Story',                                photo: 'moses-hutton-mays.jpg' },
          { name: 'Kristifir Klein',          role: 'Sets & Character Modeling',            photo: 'kristifir-klein.jpg' },
          { name: 'Lars Minsaas',             role: 'Technical Director',                   photo: 'lars-minsaas.jpg' },
          { name: 'Pranav Sood',              role: 'Animator',                             photo: 'prnav-sood.jpg' },
          { name: 'Peter Kerkvliet',          role: 'Animator',                             photo: 'peter-kerkvliet.png' },
          { name: 'Cassidy Johnson',          role: 'Animator',                             photo: 'cassidy-johnson.jpg' },
          { name: 'Drew McGaraghan',          role: 'Graphics & Title Design',              photo: 'drew-mcgaraghan.jpg' },
          { name: 'Blake Cahill',             role: 'Modeling & Set Dress',                 photo: 'blake-cahill.jpg' },
          { name: 'Lauryn Smith',             role: 'Modeling & Set Dress',                 photo: 'lauryn-smith.jpg' },
          { name: 'Jeremiah Moore',           role: 'Sound Design & Mix',                   photo: 'jeremiah-moore.jpg' },
          { name: 'Mark Orton',               role: 'Original Score',                       photo: 'mark-orton.jpg' },
          { name: 'John Hancock',             role: 'Original Score',                       photo: 'john-hancock.jpg' },
          { name: 'Gary Coates',              role: 'Color & DCP',                          photo: 'gary-coates.webp' },
          { name: 'Domenic Allen',            role: '2D Animation',                         photo: 'domenic-allen.jpg' },
          { name: 'Lucas Curtis',             role: 'Color Scripts',                        photo: 'lucas-curtis.jpg' },
          { name: 'Clay Welch',               role: 'Systems',                              photo: null },
          { name: 'Shane Finley',             role: 'Character Modeling',                   photo: null },
        ].map(({ name, role, photo }) => (
          <div class="team-member">
            <div class="team-photo">
              {photo && <img src={`/images/team/${photo}`} alt={name} loading="lazy" />}
              <div class="photo-fallback" aria-hidden="true">
                {name.split(' ').slice(0, 2).map(n => n[0]).join('')}
              </div>
            </div>
            <span class="member-name">{name}</span>
            <span class="member-role">{role}</span>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


</Layout>

<style>
  /* Hero */
  .about-hero {
    min-height: 75vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    padding-block: 8rem 5rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image: url('/images/about-team.jpg');
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center 35%;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;
  }

  .hero-bg::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(8, 3, 22, 0.72) 0%, rgba(8, 3, 22, 0.45) 50%, rgba(8, 3, 22, 0.25) 100%),
      linear-gradient(to top, rgba(8, 3, 22, 0.85) 0%, rgba(8, 3, 22, 0.30) 35%, transparent 65%);
  }

  .hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .hero-content .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .display { font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 9vw, 8rem); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .accent-text { color: var(--accent); }

  .hero-sub {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.2rem);
    color: var(--fg-2);
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 520px;
  }

  /* Shared section bg + tight vertical rhythm */
  .founders-section,
  .leadership-section,
  .advisors-section,
  .team-section,
  .cta-section {
    background: linear-gradient(to right, #080316 0%, #1c0832 100%);
    padding-block: clamp(2.5rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
  }

  .build-with-intro {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.2rem);
    color: var(--fg-2);
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  /* ─── Principles ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .how-section {
    background: #080316;
  }
  .principles-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .principles-left {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    position: sticky;
    top: 7rem;
    max-width: 220px;
  }
  .principles {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  }
  .principle {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 50px 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 2rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
  }
  .principle:last-child { border-bottom: none; padding-bottom: 0; }
  .principle:first-child { padding-top: 0; }
  .principle-icon {
    color: var(--accent);
    padding-top: 0.3rem;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
  .principle-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .principle-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 1.6rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 0.125rem;
  }
  .principle-body p {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--fg);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .founders-section  { border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); }
  .leadership-section { border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); }
  .advisors-section  { border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); }
  .team-section      { border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); }
  .cta-section       { border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); }

  .founders-section .eyebrow,
  .leadership-section .eyebrow,
  .advisors-section .eyebrow,
  .team-section .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 1rem; }

  .founders-section .subheadline,
  .leadership-section .subheadline,
  .advisors-section .subheadline,
  .team-section .subheadline { margin-bottom: 3rem; }

  /* ── Photo placeholder shared ── */
  .founder-photo,
  .person-photo,
  .advisor-photo {
    position: relative;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .founder-photo img,
  .person-photo img,
  .advisor-photo img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center center;
    display: block;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .founder-card:last-child .founder-photo img {
    transform: scale(1.2);
    transform-origin: center center;
  }

  .photo-fallback {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
    z-index: 0;
  }

  /* ── Founders ── */
  .founders-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .founder-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    grid-template-rows: auto 1fr;
    align-items: start;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.02);
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: var(--transition);
  }

  .founder-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
  }

  .founder-photo {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    border-radius: 0;
    grid-column: 1;
    grid-row: 1 / 3;
  }

  .founder-photo .photo-fallback { font-size: 4rem; }

  .founder-header {
    grid-column: 2;
    grid-row: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 2rem 2.25rem 1rem;
  }

  .founder-bios {
    grid-column: 2;
    grid-row: 2;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.875rem;
    padding: 0 2.25rem 2rem;
    align-self: start;
  }

  .founder-name {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .founder-title {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .founder-bio {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--fg-2);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .founder-bio + .founder-bio {
    margin-top: 0.875rem;
  }

  /* ── Leadership ── */
  .leadership-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .person-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    align-items: start;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .person-photo {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    position: relative;
  }

  .person-photo .photo-fallback { font-size: 3rem; }

  .person-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    align-self: start;
  }

  .person-name {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .person-title {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .person-bio {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--fg-2);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .person-known {
    display: block;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--fg-3);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }

  /* ── Advisors ── */
  .advisors-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .advisor-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    align-items: start;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .advisor-photo {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    position: relative;
  }

  .advisor-photo .photo-fallback { font-size: 3rem; }

  .advisor-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    align-self: center;
  }

  .advisor-name {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .advisor-affil {
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
  }

  .advisor-bio {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    color: var(--fg-2);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  /* ── Team list ── */
  .team-list {
    display: grid;
